# These crate sources are committed verbatim apart from the documented Maple
# patch, and cargo compiles them straight from this directory — a single
# dropped file breaks every build on a fresh clone. Override every inherited
# ignore (the repo's `target/` and `**/bin/` rules in particular) so the tree
# is always complete.
!*

# …but never let local-only junk in. `!*` above re-enables every inherited
# ignore, so re-ignore the usual editor/OS artifacts here. No published crate
# ships these names, so this can't drop a real source file.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
